  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:380px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orangered pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Emotion Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/75/Pollymindscan.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20111229235820\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Pollymindscan\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/75/Pollymindscan.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20111229235820\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/75/Pollymindscan.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20111229235820 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/75/Pollymindscan.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20111229235820 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Pollymindscan\" width=\"270\" height=\"203\" data-image-key=\"Pollymindscan.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Pollymindscan.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Polymorph (Red Dwarf) extracting Lister's fear.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb emotions.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"They don't need walls and water to keep the prisoners in, not when they're trapped inside their own heads, incapable of a single cheerful thought. Most go mad within weeks.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Remus Lupin on the Azkaban prisoners' long-term exposure to Dementors (Harry Potter)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb emotions and utilize them in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Manipulation\" title=\"Emotion Manipulation\">Emotion Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Empowerment\" title=\"Emotion Empowerment\">Emotion Empowerment</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEmotion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Emotional/Empathic/Emotion Devouring/Feeding/Theft</li>\n<li>Emotional/Empathic Absorption/Ingestion</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEmotion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can fully or partially absorb emotions, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently. Targets of the draining often lose motivation due to the sudden loss of intense emotions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEmotion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield_Construction\" title=\"Assimilation Shield Construction\">Assimilation Shield Construction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Empowerment\" title=\"Emotion Empowerment\">Emotion Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Negation\" title=\"Emotion Negation\">Emotion Negation</a> by absorbing all emotions.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotional_Vampirism\" title=\"Emotional Vampirism\">Emotional Vampirism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Enhanced\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Enhanced\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Supernatural\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_Immunity\" title=\"Fear Immunity\">Fear Immunity</a> by absorbing fear.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> (limited to <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Emotion-based_Abilities\" title=\"Category:Emotion-based Abilities\">emotion-based powers</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Serenity_Inducement\" title=\"Serenity Inducement\">Serenity Inducement</a> by absorbing anger.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEmotion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Anger_Absorption\" title=\"Anger Absorption\">Anger Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_Absorption\" title=\"Fear Absorption\">Fear Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Happiness_Absorption\" title=\"Happiness Absorption\">Happiness Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Hatred_Absorption\" title=\"Hatred Absorption\">Hatred Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Love_Absorption\" title=\"Love Absorption\">Love Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pain_Absorption\" title=\"Pain Absorption\">Pain Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sadness_Absorption\" title=\"Sadness Absorption\">Sadness Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEmotion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Manipulation\" title=\"Emotion Manipulation\">Emotion Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotional_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Emotional Energy Manipulation\">Emotional Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotional_Vampirism\" title=\"Emotional Vampirism\">Emotional Vampirism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intuitive_Empathy\" title=\"Intuitive Empathy\">Intuitive Empathy</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEmotion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>User of <a href=\"/wiki/Apathy\" title=\"Apathy\">Apathy</a> or beings who lack emotions are immune.</li>\n<li>May be limited to the emotions that are on surface.</li>\n<li>May be psychologically affected by the emotions they are absorbed.\n<ul><li>May stem from different types of emotions being mixed together.</li></ul></li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Immunity\" title=\"Assimilation Immunity\">Assimilation Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEmotion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li>Terumi Yuuki (<i>BlazBlue</i>)</li>\n<li>Raven (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Polymorph (<i>Red Dwarf</i>)</li>\n<li>Emohawk (<i>Red Dwarf</i>)</li>\n<li>Alien Brains (<i>Courage the Cowardly Dog</i>)</li>\n<li>Evronians (<i>Disney's PK</i>)</li>\n<li>Zombozo (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li>Clem (<i>Buffy the Vampire Slayer/Angel</i>)</li>\n<li>Loose-Skinned Demons (<i>Buffy the Vampire Slayer</i>)</li>\n<li>Pearl (<i>Angel &amp; Faith</i>)</li>\n<li>Nash (<i>Angel &amp; Faith</i>)</li>\n<li>Vanitas (<i>Kingdom Hearts Birth by Sleep</i>)</li>\n<li>Unversed (<i>Kingdom Hearts Birth by Sleep</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5659\">Jarilo/SCP-5659 - A Beast of Lust And Hatred Born</a></li>\n<li>Mother Mae-Eye (<i>Teen Titans</i>)</li>\n<li>Lorophage Demons (<i>Angel &amp; Faith</i>)</li>\n<li>Lilitu (<i>Angel: Auld Lang Syne</i>)</li>\n<li>Xellos (<i>Slayers</i>)</li>\n<li>Shuppet (<i>Pokemon</i>); only negative emotions</li>\n<li>Knox (<i>Heroes</i>)</li>\n<li>Dark Kahn (<i>Mortal Kombat vs. DC Universe</i>)</li>\n<li>Dementors (<i>Harry Potter</i>)</li>\n<li>Croix Meridies (<i>Little Witch Academia</i>); via Pixels</li>\n<li>No Face (<i>Spirited Away</i>)</li>\n<li>Darkseid (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Raven (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Psycho-Pirate (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>D'Spayre (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Absence (<i>Marvel Comics</i>): persona of Legion</li>\n<li>Vigo the Carpathian (<i>Ghostbusters II</i>)</li>\n<li>Vampires (<i>Anita Blake</i>)</li>\n<li>Wraiths (<i>Supernatural</i>)</li>\n<li>Rinshi (<i>Power Rangers Jungle Fury</i>)</li>\n<li>Thesulac Demons (<i>Angel</i>)</li>\n<li>Gachnar (<i>Buffy the Vampire Slayer</i>)</li>\n<li>Barbas (<i>Charmed</i>)</li>\n<li>Fair Folk (<i>Exalted</i>)</li>\n<li>Darkhood (<i>Dungeons &amp; Dragons</i>)</li>\n<li>Dark Gaia (<i>Sonic Unleashed</i>)</li>\n<li>Kogasa Tatara (<i>Touhou Project</i>)</li>\n<li>Hata no Kokoro (<i>Touhou Project</i>)</li>\n<li>Penelope Spectra (<i>Danny Phantom</i>)</li>\n<li>Astaroth (<i>Valkyrie Crusade</i>)</li>\n<li>Sadao Maou (<i>The Devil is a Part-Timer!</i>)</li>\n<li>Changelings (<i>My Little Pony Friendship is Magic</i>); only love</li>\n<li>Alex Chen (<i>Life is Strange: True Colors</i>)</li>\n<li>Ragstone (<i>Ultraman Cosmos</i>)</li>\n<li>Tandy Bowen/Dagger (<i>Marvel Cinematic Universe</i>); only hope</li>\n<li>Utopia Dopant (<i>Kamen Rider W</i>); only hope</li>\n<li>Bakjam/Bakugami (<i>Madan no Ichi</i>/<i>Ichi the Witch</i>)</li>\n<li>Ichi (<i>Madan no Ichi</i>/<i>Ichi the Witch</i>); via Bakjam, only negative emotions</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEmotion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Utopia Memory (<i>Kamen Rider W</i>)</li>\n<li>Pixels (<i>Little Witch Academia</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEmotion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D9&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"5ad3829b46a3193a0d773e367ef92bcb\" data-seq-no=\